# 大きな表 (docs/private/fixed-buffer-audit.md 10), for tools/ui_run.py:
# a sheet of 100000 rows and 10 columns (a million cells, the last column
# of each row a formula of the first two), made as a copy of the 基本表計算
# template (mkbig) and opened; a SUM of the whole first column typed in K1
# and its value checked, a cell of the first column changed so that the
# SUM and the row's formula are worked out again, the sheet saved
# (Ctrl+S), closed, opened again and found the same as it was saved.
# The times are printed ("time ..." and "under ...").
# The template's window is at 100,100, its first cell at 200,163.
# Keys: → 4F, ← 50, ↑ 52, Enter 28, S 16, E 08 with Ctrl (01).
mkbig calc 100000 10
mark
open big
waitwin 基本表計算 1200
sync 600
under open 60000
expect calc: ready 基本表計算 cells 1000000
shot big_calc_open
click 200 163
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
key 4F
sync 600
hostmark
text =SUM(A1:A100000)
key 28
expectin 600 calc: set K1 shows 49999500000
hosttime sum 60000
shot big_calc_sum
key 52
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
key 50
hostmark
text 1000000
key 28
expectin 600 calc: set A1 shows 1000000
sync 600
hosttime change 10000
mark
key 16 01
expectin 600 calc: saved
sync 600
under saved 60000
sum
keep saved
key 08 01
sync 600
mark
open big
waitwin 基本表計算 1200
sync 600
under reopen 60000
shot big_calc_reopen
key 08 01
sync 600
sum
same saved
absent !OACV!
